gametitle=Kingdom Hearts II Final Mix (SLPM-66675, CRC F266B00B)
comment=Two-player project, lane K DEMO (study, not for play): lane A base: S->pad per updating player object; identity rule: routines 0x000F0300-0x000F040B; exit rule (both heroes, either walks in): routines 0x000F0420-0x000F058B; twin's stick is turned by camera 2's view; lane K demo: second camera + two-view render mode, routines 0x000F0E00-0x000F0F03; views side by side.
comment=Every PC in a linked test must have this same file (it changes game code).
